<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Register — Public Service Portal</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0b1f3a;
    --navy-dark: #071527;
    --orange: #e8701a;
    --orange-dark: #c85e10;
